Except for single ingredient foods, a list of ingredients shall be declared on the label in the following manner:
(a) The list of ingredients shall contain an appropriate title, such as the term "Ingredients";
(b) The name of Ingredients used in the product shall be listed in descending order of their composition by weight or volume, as the case may be, at the time of its manufacture;

CS DJ No. 224/2017 page no. 8 of 16  (c) A specific name shall be used for ingredients in the list  of Ingredients;
Provided that for ingredients falling in the respective classes, the following class titles may be used,
namely: Classes Class Titles xxxxxx xxxxx Cocoa bean, coconib, cocomass, cocoa Cocoa solids press cakes cocoa powder (fine/dust) ..."
